<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="070" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Implement H12a AI seed chain handler — invokes manifest per single-AI-routing-surface end state</title>
    <phase>C' Config-Seed Manifest + H12/H14 Implementations</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Task tags include 'l2-controlplane','job-handler','ai','dataverse'; implements a handler in the DAG whose failure blocks Setup Status = Ready. FR-15 acceptance scope.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Single-component IJobHandler implementation following canonical Services/Jobs/**/*Handler.cs pattern, invoking the task-069 manifest generator. Step 3.5.5b sonnet @ high.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>waveCp-parallel</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>069</deps>
    <tags>l2-controlplane, job-handler, ai, dataverse</tags>
    <estimated-effort>3-5 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Implement the H12a AI seed chain handler as an IJobHandler in the L2 control plane per spec.md FR-15. H12a invokes scripts/seed-data/Invoke-SeedManifest.ps1 (from task 069) which fans out to Deploy-All-AI-SeedData.ps1 + Seed-PlaybookConsumers.ps1. Ends the seed chain at `playbook consumers` per ADR-039 (single AI routing surface end state; spaarke-playbook-embeddings retired). Handler idempotency key: h12a-{customerId}-{manifestHash}.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in IJobHandler contract (ADR-004), PowerShell-invocation-from-C# patterns (System.Management.Automation or process shell-out), and the AI seed chain shape per ADR-039. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

  <goal>File src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H12aSeedChainHandler.cs exists, implements IJobHandler, registers in L2 DI, invokes Invoke-SeedManifest.ps1 with target customer Dataverse env, and asserts idempotency + reports outcome to Cosmos runNotes. Unit tests cover happy path + manifest-failure path + idempotency.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Per spec.md FR-15 + ADR-039 + design.md §4.1 H12a row: the AI seed chain populates every AI-related record type (type-lookups → actions → tools → knowledge → skills → playbooks → output-types → playbook consumers) in the target customer's Dataverse env. H12a is the ONE handler that owns this chain; the manifest (task 069) is the authoritative source; the retired spaarke-playbook-embeddings index MUST NOT be re-introduced.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H12aSeedChainHandler.cs</file>
      <file role="new">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H12aSeedChainHandler.Tests.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Program.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">scripts/seed-data/Invoke-SeedManifest.ps1</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Jobs/IdempotencyService.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/Jobs/</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="069" status="pending">manifest.yaml + Invoke-SeedManifest.ps1 generator</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="spec.md FR-15">SCOPE: AI seed chain ends at `playbook consumers` per ADR-039; ends with sprk_aimodeldeployment placeholder rows (H12c will populate values).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">SCOPE: MUST NOT re-introduce spaarke-playbook-embeddings index or dispatcher artifacts (retired end state).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-004">SCOPE: Single IJobHandler; one message, one handler, one outcome.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-010">SCOPE: H12a registers in L2 control-plane DI container, NOT the BFF.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-036">SCOPE: 3-level idempotency (MessageId + Redis lock + deterministic key h12a-{customerId}-{manifestHash}).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: manifestHash is a deterministic SHA-256 of manifest.yaml content — a change to the manifest changes the key and forces a re-seed on next invocation.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: Handler MUST NOT invoke seeder scripts directly — MUST go through Invoke-SeedManifest.ps1 so the single-source-of-truth manifest governs.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>H12a AI seed chain handler invoking single-source seed manifest</topic>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-004-job-contract.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-036-background-job-infrastructure.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-039-grounded-execution-closed-catalogs.md</file>
      <file>.claude/constraints/jobs.md</file>
      <file>.claude/constraints/ai.md</file>
      <file>projects/customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1/spec.md</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Reference handler shape" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/Jobs/">Any AI-Jobs handler is a shape exemplar — copy constructor injection + HandleAsync signature.</pattern>
      <pattern name="3-level idempotency" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Jobs/IdempotencyService.cs">Reuse the shared idempotency stack.</pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL (FULL). Load spec.md FR-15 + ADR-039 + task 069 manifest shape.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Inventory">Read L2 scaffold + reference AI-Jobs handlers.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Author">Author H12aSeedChainHandler.cs — inject IIdempotencyService, ICosmosRunStore, IPowerShellInvoker (or similar), IConfiguration.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Idempotency">Compute manifestHash = SHA-256 of scripts/seed-data/manifest.yaml; idempotency key = h12a-{customerId}-{manifestHash}.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Invoke">HandleAsync invokes Invoke-SeedManifest.ps1 with -TargetDataverseUrl {customer.sprk_dataverseurl} -TenantId {customer.sprk_tenantid}; captures exit code + stdout/stderr.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Retired check">On startup, verify manifest does NOT reference spaarke-playbook-embeddings or dispatcher (defense-in-depth against task 069 drift).</step>
    <step order="6" name="Register">Register in L2 Program.cs DI.</step>
    <step order="7" name="Tests">Unit tests: happy path; manifest-invoke failure path (non-zero exit); idempotency (second invocation with same manifestHash = no-op).</step>
    <step order="8" name="Verify">dotnet build + dotnet test = green; dotnet format; zero analyzer warnings.</step>
    <step order="9" name="Index update">Update TASK-INDEX.md: task 070 → ✅.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Deviations">Document any deviation in projects/customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="dotnet">Build and test the L2 control-plane project</tool>
    <tool name="terminal">Run shell commands</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H12aSeedChainHandler.cs</output>
    <output type="code">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Program.cs (DI registration)</output>
    <output type="test">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H12aSeedChainHandler.Tests.cs</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">H12aSeedChainHandler implements IJobHandler and registers in L2 DI.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">HandleAsync invokes Invoke-SeedManifest.ps1 with the target customer's Dataverse URL + tenantId; captures exit code.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Idempotency key = h12a-{customerId}-{SHA256(manifest.yaml)}; second invocation with same key is a no-op.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Handler startup verifies manifest.yaml does NOT reference spaarke-playbook-embeddings or dispatcher; fails startup if it does.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the seeder script exits non-zero, when HandleAsync runs, then handler returns Failed with stderr captured in Cosmos runNotes.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: HandleAsync invoked without customer.sprk_dataverseurl returns Failed with clear diagnostic; does NOT invoke the script.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">dotnet build exits 0; dotnet test exits 0; zero analyzer warnings.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Reference: spec.md FR-15 + ADR-039 + task 069 manifest. Sibling handlers H12b (task 071) + H12c (task 072) are DAG-parallel.</notes>

  <execution>
    <skill>.claude/skills/task-execute/SKILL.md</skill>
  </execution>
</task>
